{"kind":"component","id":"d2332d74-e8b9-42e2-a1ec-059022cf0f4f","type":"3b7d2e95-6a41-4c8f-9e1d-5f0a8c27b6d3","name":"Natural Vibration Analysis (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Natural Vibration","desc":"Solves the eigenvalue problem of the model and returns its modes, eigenvalues, periods and frequencies.\nIt needs no Analysis Settings - an eigenvalue problem has nothing to converge. Connect the assembled model, or an analysed one for the modes of the model it was analysed from - Section Optimiser's last design, say. Feed the solved model to Nodal Displacements to read a mode shape.\nThe modal report - masses, centre of mass, participation factors and mass ratios - is in the Modal Report menu below the component.","box":[-2,510,1823,104],"pivot":[1686,562],"inputs":[{"id":"a07087c6-99af-47a6-ad58-2edd8ced62f7","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[1630,512,41,33],"src":["b6ecdbf9-5c01-4cd8-84c0-7a1119d12d69"]},{"id":"cba1037d-a7a4-4c57-a079-4a756917d418","name":"Vibration Modes","nick":"Vibration Modes","box":[1630,545,41,33],"src":["66d645fc-2c61-4ea7-a328-fab7474c8aae"]},{"id":"78d2c028-650b-401a-a627-73c84a0a83cb","name":"Solver","nick":"Solver","box":[1630,578,41,34],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"590b6a1e-d901-4419-86f5-4ac2ce496fe7","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[1701,512,118,20],"src":[]},{"id":"d9cc0f93-ed77-44fa-9004-be8c349a264f","name":"Eigenvalues","nick":"Eigenvalues","box":[1701,532,118,20],"src":[]},{"id":"d931fccb-7677-45ea-a422-47a0d768467a","name":"Period","nick":"Period","box":[1701,552,118,20],"src":[]},{"id":"d5c21730-0e21-406d-b681-62a78a55e88e","name":"Frequencies","nick":"Frequencies","box":[1701,572,118,20],"src":[]},{"id":"8dd3dace-1ea9-466c-8bf5-4aa03d8b9163","name":"log","nick":"log","box":[1701,592,118,20],"src":[]},{"id":"65a7c4dd-8f2e-4480-98d6-3cec2c878f01","name":"EigenValueAnalysis","nick":"EigenValueAnalysis","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"4a03cf1a-6645-463c-b8cd-af360043471d","name":"TotalMassOfStructure","nick":"TotalMassOfStructure","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"abc950a7-0dcf-4001-bf66-2dabbd6b1820","name":"TotalFreeMass","nick":"TotalFreeMass","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"6dbff367-4b20-473b-a6b1-3f631aaf6f85","name":"CenterOfMass","nick":"CenterOfMass","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"67d966fd-a4a6-4569-aaa0-7841aecd758e","name":"ModalParticipationFactors","nick":"ModalParticipationFactors","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"49a8a654-d3f3-40a9-aa40-005a752cc12c","name":"ModalParticipationMasses","nick":"ModalParticipationMasses","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"f9721b00-4420-4e06-aa91-cc83dc159405","name":"ModalParticipationMasses_Cumulative","nick":"ModalParticipationMasses_Cumulative","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"a5608c05-37f5-4cd6-9945-f31775eddf5d","name":"ModalParticipationMassesRatio(%)","nick":"ModalParticipationMassesRatio(%)","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]},{"id":"3b3c51a0-aedc-4beb-bc4c-f6ed12c323f5","name":"ModalParticipationMassesRatio(%)_Cumulative","nick":"ModalParticipationMassesRatio(%)_Cumulative","box":[0,0,150,20],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"panel","id":"fd20a84d-068b-4ee8-950c-f1b2a4270d07","type":"59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c","name":"Panel","nick":"Frequencies","desc":"A panel for custom notes and text values","box":[1909,562,120,64],"src":["d5c21730-0e21-406d-b681-62a78a55e88e"],"text":"Double click to edit panel content…","colour":[255,255,250,90]},
{"kind":"component","id":"2dc4d3e8-6d2b-442f-9518-bdaff55250f4","type":"f6d1efd4-82a3-4a0f-b4b7-6dd0ee9fcade","name":"Model View (Alpaca4d)","nick":"The deck","desc":"Draw the model and its results in the viewport.\nTick one or more results under Results - displacements, beam forces and stresses, shell forces and stresses, solid stresses, reactions - to draw them together, each with its own component and unit. Under Beam forces, tick any of N, Vy, Vz, T, My and Mz to draw their diagrams together. They need a model from Run Analysis or another analysis. Each element is coloured by one result: an element's own stress or force before the displacement, which colours the rest.\nWith none ticked, the elements are coloured by element, section or material.\nNode and element ids, section names, local axes, end releases, loads and supports can be drawn over either, from the Elements, Loads and Supports menus.\nElementId shows only some of the elements and greys the rest, so what you are looking at stays in the model around it.\nGeometry hands out what is drawn as coloured meshes and lines - move it, or bake it.\nWith Extruded on, beam stresses that differ across a section - σx, σMy, σMz, τV, τT, Von Mises - are painted point by point over it; drawn as lines, each section shows its worst.\nA vibration or buckling mode is drawn at deformation scale 1 with its largest movement as far off the model as the diagrams stand; any other displacement at true size. On a natural vibration or buckling model the scale runs from -2 to 2, so Animate swings the mode both ways.","box":[2116.5,510,230,378],"pivot":[2230,572],"inputs":[{"id":"75dcb05d-1fc4-4db0-acc7-42195303957e","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[2118.5,512,96.5,20],"src":["590b6a1e-d901-4419-86f5-4ac2ce496fe7"]},{"id":"5f0da21a-27af-4e94-bdb9-a61eb129aa8e","name":"Step","nick":"Step","box":[2118.5,532,96.5,20],"src":[]},{"id":"26438f04-02ca-4d40-b467-08a8705c0169","name":"ElementId","nick":"ElementId","box":[2118.5,552,96.5,20],"src":[]},{"id":"3f371d1c-9761-420c-8190-c3e88954262b","name":"Colors","nick":"Colors","box":[2118.5,572,96.5,20],"src":[]},{"id":"96ef6dd7-8b9e-41bd-bb6a-ae3a0cddb8a1","name":"Range","nick":"Range","box":[2118.5,592,96.5,20],"src":[]},{"id":"800d943e-e804-4647-a068-a2f27c3b0104","name":"LoadPattern","nick":"LP","box":[2118.5,612,96.5,20],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"c6d3d446-f9b4-4d2a-92e9-825f929cdb8a","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[2245,512,99.5,24],"src":[]},{"id":"5a52f8ba-6933-401a-945b-b656da648a41","name":"Geometry","nick":"Geometry","box":[2245,536,99.5,24],"src":[]},{"id":"a4fa8361-4ec8-458b-9731-84fe3f30b349","name":"Info","nick":"Info","box":[2245,560,99.5,24],"src":[]},{"id":"a29b315c-af37-4aa7-a171-9bec0eb7a69b","name":"Values","nick":"Values","box":[2245,584,99.5,24],"src":[]},{"id":"b9ccd300-c452-4ae4-88a4-306781a129ae","name":"Colors","nick":"Colors","box":[2245,608,99.5,24],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"component","id":"db598c26-12d9-4f40-bbd5-c0536411af05","type":"ccc7b468-e743-4049-891f-299432545898","name":"Curve Middle","nick":"Mid-span","desc":"Get the point in the middle of a curve","box":[803,959,55,40],"pivot":[829,979],"inputs":[{"id":"66cff2ff-3971-4836-b13a-8e424b4c2fd3","name":"Curve","nick":"C","box":[805,961,9,36],"src":["953e595e-a7e6-4c75-af74-2dfff1cad41b"]}],"outputs":[{"id":"f91413a1-afe8-47ee-a46e-dc7c32a806fd","name":"Midpoint","nick":"M","box":[844,961,12,36],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"component","id":"3c8bb541-b43b-4046-8335-ec1e91e86b9d","type":"c4e1d7a2-58b6-4f03-8e2a-1b9f6d3a7c05","name":"Support (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Pier","desc":"A support. Rigid: fixes the node along and about the axes of the Position's plane you choose. Elastic: a spring along or about each axis of the plane. Compression Only: holds the node only while it pushes into the support, along the plane's Z, and lets it lift - after a gap, if there is one.\nElastic and Compression Only never fix the node themselves, so a Rigid support on the same point can hold what they leave free: a pinned bearing that can lift is a Compression Only support with a Rigid one holding Tx and Ty only.\nReaction Force gives a spring support a row of its own, with the spring's force.","box":[993,907,82,144],"pivot":[1032,979],"inputs":[{"id":"0f8a7942-2092-4fb5-9a98-3e93c590dc5c","name":"Position","nick":"Position","box":[995,909,22,20],"src":["f91413a1-afe8-47ee-a46e-dc7c32a806fd"]},{"id":"8ef88989-faac-4e06-b666-32257daa20bf","name":"Tx","nick":"Tx","box":[995,929,22,20],"src":["e1197066-94f3-4692-98e5-70e1d783a20a"]},{"id":"0352e1d8-bee6-4d2b-ba7b-b19d8c2a17ab","name":"Ty","nick":"Ty","box":[995,949,22,20],"src":[]},{"id":"1d131185-6bc0-4463-9604-d6442d04cde5","name":"Tz","nick":"Tz","box":[995,969,22,20],"src":[]},{"id":"95c3e415-61a0-4fc2-8607-d5948487d1e0","name":"Rx","nick":"Rx","box":[995,989,22,20],"src":[]},{"id":"db42d850-090a-4052-9a48-a5f9033a73ba","name":"Ry","nick":"Ry","box":[995,1009,22,20],"src":["e1197066-94f3-4692-98e5-70e1d783a20a"]},{"id":"56a39888-3ce2-4261-b310-c5dba3783d09","name":"Rz","nick":"Rz","box":[995,1029,22,20],"src":["e1197066-94f3-4692-98e5-70e1d783a20a"]}],"outputs":[{"id":"9c63f031-1121-421f-a216-9b3d4bd85318","name":"Support","nick":"Support","box":[1047,909,26,140],"src":[]}],"unit":"Support Rigid"},
